WEBVTT

00:00:02.035 --> 00:00:03.798
Last time
on Star Trek: Voyager...

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:05.394
I believe

00:00:05.472 --> 00:00:06.404
we know each other.

00:00:06.473 --> 00:00:07.633
You're Tuvok, right?

00:00:07.707 --> 00:00:10.073
We met last week at
the shift briefing.

00:00:10.143 --> 00:00:12.611
Before that.
Before we were working here.

00:00:12.679 --> 00:00:14.078
Oh, I don't think so.

00:00:14.147 --> 00:00:15.444
A romantic relationship

00:00:15.515 --> 00:00:17.506
is really out of the question
for me right now, and when

00:00:17.584 --> 00:00:19.051
- you started asking...
- How about a friend?

00:00:19.119 --> 00:00:20.108
What?

00:00:20.186 --> 00:00:22.051
Could you use a friend?

00:00:22.122 --> 00:00:23.146
It's nice to be in a place

00:00:23.223 --> 00:00:24.952
where different species
get along so well.

00:00:25.025 --> 00:00:26.583
Oh, so, you admit
we're getting along?

00:00:26.659 --> 00:00:27.683
Kim to Chakotay.

00:00:27.761 --> 00:00:28.955
Go ahead.

00:00:29.029 --> 00:00:30.360
I've found them, Commander.

00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:32.330
- Let go of me!
- I'm not going to hurt you.

00:00:34.868 --> 00:00:35.562
No!

00:00:35.635 --> 00:00:37.102
No!

00:00:38.671 --> 00:00:40.434
Harry, I need
an emergency transport now!

00:00:46.146 --> 00:00:47.113
No, leave me alone!

00:00:47.180 --> 00:00:49.239
We're friends;
we're trying to help you.

00:00:49.315 --> 00:00:50.646
No, don't touch me!

00:00:50.717 --> 00:00:53.481
I don't believe you are
who you think you are!

00:00:54.621 --> 00:00:56.987
We don't belong here.

00:00:57.057 --> 00:00:58.081
This isn't right!

00:00:58.158 --> 00:00:59.648
We don't belong here!

00:00:59.726 --> 00:01:00.920
And now the conclusion.

00:01:09.502 --> 00:01:10.434
Wait here.

00:01:10.503 --> 00:01:11.902
Yes, sir.

00:01:38.231 --> 00:01:41.200
He's deactivated a safety field.

00:01:43.970 --> 00:01:46.598
Alert Emergency Medical.

00:01:46.673 --> 00:01:47.640
He may have tried to ju...

00:02:17.137 --> 00:02:19.367
I can't penetrate their shields.

00:02:20.507 --> 00:02:22.805
Maybe we don't have to.

00:02:22.876 --> 00:02:24.741
The Battle of Vorkado.

00:02:24.811 --> 00:02:27.302
It's in my tactical database.

00:02:27.380 --> 00:02:28.711
A Romulan Captain disabled

00:02:28.781 --> 00:02:30.544
two attacking vessels
by creating

00:02:30.617 --> 00:02:32.778
a photonic shock wave
between the ships.

00:02:32.852 --> 00:02:33.944
How'd he do that?

00:02:34.020 --> 00:02:35.647
Watch and learn.

00:02:42.862 --> 00:02:45.296
I don't think they'll
be bothering us again.

00:02:45.365 --> 00:02:48.698
Good work. Let's go
back for Chakotay.

00:02:48.768 --> 00:02:49.962
Five more ships

00:02:50.036 --> 00:02:51.264
on an intercept course.

00:02:51.337 --> 00:02:53.862
What's your tactical database
telling you now?

00:02:53.940 --> 00:02:58.138
Transporters are damaged.
Shields are failing.

00:02:58.211 --> 00:02:59.974
We have to retreat,
come up with a new plan.

00:03:00.046 --> 00:03:01.536
Agreed.

00:03:26.506 --> 00:03:28.235
Listen, I'm sorry
about my friend.

00:03:28.308 --> 00:03:30.037
Excuse me?

00:03:30.109 --> 00:03:31.269
Jaffen.

00:03:31.344 --> 00:03:34.177
He wasn't very nice
when I invited you to join us.

00:03:37.083 --> 00:03:38.516
Are you all right?

00:03:38.585 --> 00:03:40.553
I'm just a little tired.

00:03:40.620 --> 00:03:42.520
First day on a new job.

00:03:42.589 --> 00:03:44.352
I know how that can be.

00:03:44.424 --> 00:03:45.652
Well, I just wanted
to let you know

00:03:45.725 --> 00:03:47.352
you're more than welcome
to sit with us.

00:03:47.427 --> 00:03:50.157
Actually, I was thinking
about going home.

00:03:50.230 --> 00:03:53.825
Well, if you change your mind,
we're celebrating.

00:03:53.900 --> 00:03:55.731
What's the occasion?

00:03:55.802 --> 00:03:57.861
I've decided
to move in with Jaffen.

00:03:59.706 --> 00:04:01.264
Congratulations.

00:05:59.692 --> 00:06:02.252
Look among the patrons.

00:06:14.407 --> 00:06:16.898
Yerid, Criminal Investigations.

00:06:16.976 --> 00:06:19.809
We run an honest business.

00:06:19.879 --> 00:06:21.608
I'm looking for two
people who disappeared

00:06:21.681 --> 00:06:23.342
after leaving here
earlier this evening.

00:06:23.416 --> 00:06:24.747
One was a young
pregnant woman...

00:06:24.817 --> 00:06:26.751
B'Elanna?

00:06:26.819 --> 00:06:27.911
You know her?

00:06:28.054 --> 00:06:31.512
Oh, I knew I should have
walked her to the Transport.

00:06:31.591 --> 00:06:34.116
Why, did you think
someone might try to hurt her?

00:06:34.193 --> 00:06:36.093
This city is supposed
to be safe.

00:06:36.162 --> 00:06:38.790
The person with her
was described as short

00:06:38.865 --> 00:06:40.924
with mottled skin,
facial hair...

00:06:41.033 --> 00:06:42.762
Sounds like someone
who was in here earlier,

00:06:42.835 --> 00:06:44.268
a worker from the plant.

00:06:44.337 --> 00:06:45.269
Do you know his name?

00:06:45.338 --> 00:06:49.502
Uh... Neelix, I think.

00:06:49.575 --> 00:06:50.667
Did you see him

00:06:50.743 --> 00:06:52.643
talking to anyone else
while he was here?

00:06:52.712 --> 00:06:56.443
He had a friend.
Uh, Amal something.

00:06:56.516 --> 00:06:57.608
Can you describe him?

00:06:57.683 --> 00:06:58.615
Oh, I don't have to.

00:06:58.684 --> 00:07:00.049
He's sitting right over...

00:07:04.624 --> 00:07:09.721
ECH Log, Stardate 54622.4.

00:07:09.796 --> 00:07:12.629
I've found an ingenious place
to hide while we make repairs...

00:07:12.698 --> 00:07:15.223
a moon
with a paramagnetic core

00:07:15.301 --> 00:07:17.895
that masks
our energy signature.

00:07:18.004 --> 00:07:19.562
I've turned my attention
to Lieutenant Torres,

00:07:19.639 --> 00:07:23.905
whose treatment
will also require ingenuity.

00:07:23.976 --> 00:07:25.603
The scan on the left
was performed

00:07:25.678 --> 00:07:27.236
during B'Elanna's last physical.

00:07:27.313 --> 00:07:29.543
The one on the right,
just a few minutes ago.

00:07:29.615 --> 00:07:33.745
The memory centers of her brain
have been radically altered.

00:07:33.820 --> 00:07:35.913
People from our crew
seemed to remember

00:07:35.988 --> 00:07:37.922
parts of their real lives,

00:07:37.990 --> 00:07:40.515
but they got a lot
of the details wrong.

00:07:40.593 --> 00:07:44.029
Tom knew his name,
that he was from Earth,

00:07:44.096 --> 00:07:47.463
but he said space travel
made him sick.

00:07:47.533 --> 00:07:50.502
Whoever did this
is very sophisticated,

00:07:50.570 --> 00:07:53.664
capable of selectively
manipulating memory engrams.

00:07:53.739 --> 00:07:56.264
Some have been suppressed,
some altered,

00:07:56.342 --> 00:07:58.071
others left intact.

00:07:58.144 --> 00:07:59.611
Can you undo the damage?

00:07:59.679 --> 00:08:03.376
I believe so, but
it'll take some time.

00:08:03.449 --> 00:08:05.747
I wish I could help.

00:08:05.818 --> 00:08:06.785
Maybe you can.

00:08:06.853 --> 00:08:09.287
She'll require
several treatments.

00:08:09.355 --> 00:08:10.549
In between,
you could expose her

00:08:10.623 --> 00:08:12.750
to familiar sights
and surroundings.

00:08:12.825 --> 00:08:13.883
Say no more.

00:08:14.026 --> 00:08:17.427
I'll take her on a whirlwind
tour of her own life.

00:08:17.497 --> 00:08:18.657
Don't rush things.

00:08:18.731 --> 00:08:22.132
This is going to be
very traumatic for her.

00:08:25.204 --> 00:08:28.105
Acute anxiety, depression...

00:08:28.174 --> 00:08:29.402
When I interviewed him,
he insisted

00:08:29.475 --> 00:08:30.737
that he's not
who he's supposed to be

00:08:30.810 --> 00:08:33.244
that we've...
"stolen his katra,"

00:08:33.312 --> 00:08:34.574
whatever that is.

00:08:34.647 --> 00:08:36.615
Conclusions?

00:08:36.682 --> 00:08:39.845
Tri-lobe regression complex?
Polar-affective disorder?

00:08:39.919 --> 00:08:42.945
Neuropsychiatry isn't
a guessing game, Dr. Ravoc.

00:08:44.023 --> 00:08:46.321
Dysphoria Syndrome.

00:08:46.392 --> 00:08:48.724
You have been studying
my research.

00:08:48.794 --> 00:08:50.227
According to your work,

00:08:50.296 --> 00:08:51.593
the condition is very rare.

00:08:51.664 --> 00:08:52.596
It is.

00:08:52.665 --> 00:08:55.065
I've treated this man before.

00:08:55.134 --> 00:08:57.625
Apparently,
he's suffered a relapse.

00:08:57.703 --> 00:08:59.170
Recommended treatment?

00:08:59.238 --> 00:09:02.537
Engramatic resequencing
is typically indicated.

00:09:02.608 --> 00:09:03.973
You seem skeptical.

00:09:04.043 --> 00:09:07.171
Resequencing is
a radical procedure.

00:09:07.246 --> 00:09:08.873
If he had a malignant tumor,

00:09:08.948 --> 00:09:10.745
would you be afraid
to cut it out?

00:09:11.817 --> 00:09:12.749
No.

00:09:12.818 --> 00:09:13.842
This syndrome

00:09:13.920 --> 00:09:15.046
is just as insidious.

00:09:15.121 --> 00:09:17.214
It requires
aggressive treatment.

00:09:17.290 --> 00:09:18.416
Get started.

00:09:27.934 --> 00:09:29.026
Please...

00:09:29.101 --> 00:09:30.932
help me.

00:09:34.440 --> 00:09:36.271
That's what we're here to do.

00:09:53.526 --> 00:09:56.393
I want to know the status
of Employee 8583.

00:09:56.462 --> 00:09:58.930
Maybe it's different
where you come from,

00:09:59.031 --> 00:10:01.761
but here it's polite
to say "good morning."

00:10:01.834 --> 00:10:03.426
Good morning.

00:10:07.173 --> 00:10:09.403
8583,

00:10:09.475 --> 00:10:12.376
the man who was removed
by Security yesterday.

00:10:12.445 --> 00:10:13.844
He's been hospitalized.

00:10:13.913 --> 00:10:15.710
Is there any reason to believe

00:10:15.781 --> 00:10:18.181
that his condition
might be contagious?

00:10:18.250 --> 00:10:20.309
He came in contact
with other workers.

00:10:20.386 --> 00:10:22.354
Some of them
have expressed concern.

00:10:22.421 --> 00:10:24.912
Well, tell them not worry.

00:10:24.991 --> 00:10:26.424
Excuse me. Am I intruding?

00:10:26.492 --> 00:10:28.585
What can we do for you?

00:10:28.661 --> 00:10:29.855
I'm investigating
the disappearance

00:10:29.929 --> 00:10:32.159
of two of your employees.

00:10:32.231 --> 00:10:33.596
Who?

00:10:33.666 --> 00:10:35.463
Their names are
Neelix and Torres.

00:10:35.534 --> 00:10:37.764
Both of them failed to
report for work today.

00:10:37.837 --> 00:10:40.101
What about this man?

00:10:42.475 --> 00:10:43.407
Employee 9363.

00:10:43.476 --> 00:10:46.309
He didn't report
for his shift either.

00:10:46.379 --> 00:10:48.870
I'd like to see
his personnel file,

00:10:48.948 --> 00:10:50.813
and I'll need to
interview anyone

00:10:50.883 --> 00:10:52.714
who may know where he is.

00:10:52.785 --> 00:10:53.717
Why are you looking for him?

00:10:53.786 --> 00:10:54.718
I believe he's

00:10:54.787 --> 00:10:56.778
responsible for
the disappearance

00:10:56.856 --> 00:10:57.880
of the other two.

00:11:00.960 --> 00:11:03.190
You've only been here
three weeks.

00:11:03.262 --> 00:11:05.253
Where did you get
all these things?

00:11:05.331 --> 00:11:06.696
I'm a collector.

00:11:06.766 --> 00:11:11.533
You collect spent
plasma relays?

00:11:11.604 --> 00:11:15.370
I like to think of it
as a decorative object.

00:11:20.713 --> 00:11:26.310
You know... I think this would
look better over there.

00:11:26.385 --> 00:11:27.943
You're not going
to start telling me

00:11:28.054 --> 00:11:28.918
how to dress, are you?

00:11:28.988 --> 00:11:31.252
Where are you going?

00:11:31.323 --> 00:11:33.757
To get the rest of my things.

00:11:33.826 --> 00:11:35.691
There's more?

00:12:01.987 --> 00:12:04.046
Lights.

00:12:19.338 --> 00:12:21.431
What do you want?

00:12:21.507 --> 00:12:24.476
You told me
you were moving out.

00:12:36.355 --> 00:12:37.947
I needed a place

00:12:38.023 --> 00:12:39.957
to hide.

00:12:40.092 --> 00:12:41.753
Jaffen knows where I am.

00:12:41.827 --> 00:12:43.692
He'll come looking for me.

00:12:43.763 --> 00:12:46.527
I'm hoping
you won't tell him I'm here.

00:12:48.601 --> 00:12:50.501
They say you had something to do

00:12:50.569 --> 00:12:53.333
with the disappearance
of a woman at the plant.

00:12:54.807 --> 00:12:56.331
I did.

00:12:56.408 --> 00:12:58.968
Her name's B'Elanna.

00:12:59.044 --> 00:13:01.410
She was brought to this planet
against her will.

00:13:01.480 --> 00:13:02.742
Something was done to her

00:13:02.815 --> 00:13:04.578
so she'd forget her real life.

00:13:04.650 --> 00:13:07.414
And what, you helped her
get home?

00:13:07.486 --> 00:13:08.646
That's right.

00:13:08.721 --> 00:13:11.246
There are other people
in this city

00:13:11.323 --> 00:13:14.417
who I'm also trying to help.

00:13:14.493 --> 00:13:16.927
I'm not here to hurt anyone.

00:13:16.996 --> 00:13:18.520
You have to trust me.

00:13:18.597 --> 00:13:20.929
You're pointing a weapon at me.

00:13:30.342 --> 00:13:31.775
Go ahead.

00:13:31.844 --> 00:13:33.106
Report me.

00:13:33.179 --> 00:13:34.908
But if you do,

00:13:34.980 --> 00:13:38.416
a lot of innocent people
are going to suffer.

00:13:38.484 --> 00:13:41.385
All I'm asking for
is a place to stay

00:13:41.453 --> 00:13:44.581
until my friends
come back for me.

00:13:49.195 --> 00:13:54.064
We're going to have to do
something about that arm.

00:13:57.136 --> 00:14:00.401
The waiter... from the tavern.

00:14:00.472 --> 00:14:02.736
Lieutenant Tom Paris,
our pilot,

00:14:02.808 --> 00:14:05.777
and B'Elanna Torres,
our Chief Engineer.

00:14:05.845 --> 00:14:10.077
That picture was taken
on your honeymoon.

00:14:10.149 --> 00:14:12.242
It isn't possible.

00:14:12.318 --> 00:14:14.786
How else would we have it?

00:14:21.493 --> 00:14:24.257
It's an antique television.

00:14:24.330 --> 00:14:27.265
You gave it to Tom
as a present.

00:14:27.333 --> 00:14:29.767
He watches cartoons.

00:14:29.835 --> 00:14:32.269
Yes.

00:14:32.338 --> 00:14:35.273
How do I know that?

00:14:35.341 --> 00:14:38.310
Because you're starting
to remember.

00:14:55.361 --> 00:14:58.990
I wondered why he was
so protective of me.

00:15:01.967 --> 00:15:04.265
I'll be outside
if you need me.

00:15:30.195 --> 00:15:32.220
Your shift ended
three hours ago.

00:15:32.298 --> 00:15:38.794
My friend Jaffen,
Employee 1326... he cut himself.

00:15:38.871 --> 00:15:41.101
Removing property from these
premises is not permitted.

00:15:41.173 --> 00:15:42.902
I know, but he's just
too stubborn to go

00:15:42.975 --> 00:15:44.704
to the hospital.

00:15:44.777 --> 00:15:48.406
I promise I'll have it back
first thing in the morning.

00:15:48.480 --> 00:15:50.846
Be sure that you do.

00:16:05.965 --> 00:16:09.901
Display the personnel file
for Employee 8583.

00:16:09.969 --> 00:16:11.596
Access restricted.

00:16:11.670 --> 00:16:14.264
Security clearance verified.

00:16:17.643 --> 00:16:20.578
Display all medical
and historical data

00:16:20.646 --> 00:16:22.671
for this employee's species.

00:16:22.748 --> 00:16:23.680
Data unavailable.

00:16:23.749 --> 00:16:27.742
List all files accessed
by this employee

00:16:27.820 --> 00:16:28.582
since he's been here.

00:16:28.654 --> 00:16:30.087
Personnel files:

00:16:30.155 --> 00:16:34.091
Employee 8582:
Nozawa, Kashimuro.

00:16:34.159 --> 00:16:38.118
Employee 8584:
Janeway, Kathryn.

00:16:38.197 --> 00:16:41.428
Employee 8585:
McKenzie, William.

00:16:41.500 --> 00:16:44.765
Employee 8586:
Hansen, Annika.

00:16:44.837 --> 00:16:48.136
Employee 8587:
Anderson, Lydia.

00:16:48.207 --> 00:16:51.643
Employee 8588:
Torres, B'Elanna. Employee...

00:16:51.710 --> 00:16:54.975
You need a doctor.

00:16:57.016 --> 00:17:00.952
That'll have to wait
till I'm back on Voyager.

00:17:01.020 --> 00:17:03.215
Voyager?

00:17:03.288 --> 00:17:04.880
My ship.

00:17:04.957 --> 00:17:07.221
You live onboard?

00:17:07.292 --> 00:17:10.728
For almost seven years.

00:17:10.796 --> 00:17:14.254
Don't you ever want
to stay in one place?

00:17:18.804 --> 00:17:20.897
You seem happy here.

00:17:20.973 --> 00:17:22.907
I've got a good job.

00:17:22.975 --> 00:17:26.172
Ever consider doing something
more challenging?

00:17:26.245 --> 00:17:29.009
My job's challenging enough.

00:17:29.081 --> 00:17:30.844
You monitor reactor coils,

00:17:30.916 --> 00:17:32.713
right?

00:17:32.785 --> 00:17:34.912
You're obviously
a very capable woman.

00:17:35.020 --> 00:17:37.318
You could probably run
that power plant.

00:17:37.389 --> 00:17:40.051
Why would I want
all that responsibility?

00:17:42.027 --> 00:17:43.187
What's that?

00:17:43.262 --> 00:17:45.958
My people are trying
to contact me.

00:17:47.666 --> 00:17:48.655
Chakotay here.

00:17:48.734 --> 00:17:50.634
Are you okay, Commander?

00:17:50.702 --> 00:17:53.262
For the time being.
Can you get me out of here?

00:17:53.338 --> 00:17:54.327
No, sir.

00:17:54.406 --> 00:17:56.135
We're eight light-years away.

00:17:56.208 --> 00:17:58.699
How are you transmitting
a signal that far?

00:17:58.777 --> 00:18:01.678
We're using a triaxilating
frequency on a covariant

00:18:01.747 --> 00:18:02.679
subspace band.

00:18:02.748 --> 00:18:04.682
It was B'Elanna's idea.

00:18:04.750 --> 00:18:07.878
I take it she's feeling better.

00:18:07.953 --> 00:18:09.887
She's responded well
to treatment.

00:18:09.955 --> 00:18:12.082
Have you located anyone else
from the crew?

00:18:12.157 --> 00:18:16.355
As a matter of fact, I'm sitting
with Captain Janeway right now.

00:18:16.428 --> 00:18:17.554
How is she?

00:18:17.629 --> 00:18:19.563
A little... suspicious,

00:18:19.631 --> 00:18:22.600
just like B'Elanna was
at first.

00:18:22.668 --> 00:18:25.432
How soon can you get back
into transporter range?

00:18:25.504 --> 00:18:27.665
We'll need a couple more days
to finish repairs.

00:18:27.739 --> 00:18:28.899
What about the shield grid?

00:18:29.007 --> 00:18:30.565
I have an idea
how to shut it down.

00:18:30.642 --> 00:18:34.100
Until I get back to you,
let's maintain com silence,

00:18:34.179 --> 00:18:36.545
just in case
we're being monitored.

00:18:36.615 --> 00:18:39.743
Understood.
Good luck, Commander.

00:18:39.818 --> 00:18:41.843
Why did you call me "Captain"?

00:18:42.955 --> 00:18:45.389
Because that's who you are.

00:18:45.457 --> 00:18:47.755
That's absurd.

00:18:47.826 --> 00:18:49.589
So what are you saying?

00:18:49.661 --> 00:18:51.253
That I was brought
here by force, too?

00:18:51.330 --> 00:18:52.763
That my memories
were manipulated?

00:18:52.831 --> 00:18:54.799
I know it sounds strange, but...

00:18:54.867 --> 00:18:56.095
Helping you was a mistake.

00:18:58.270 --> 00:18:59.567
Listen to me.

00:19:01.173 --> 00:19:03.141
There are more than a hundred
members of Voyager's crew

00:19:03.208 --> 00:19:05.574
working at that power plant...
your crew.

00:19:05.644 --> 00:19:07.168
And when our ship gets here,

00:19:07.246 --> 00:19:09.111
I'll be able to prove it to you.

00:19:09.181 --> 00:19:11.206
Look...

00:19:11.283 --> 00:19:14.343
I don't want to force you to do
anything you don't want to,

00:19:14.419 --> 00:19:17.047
but don't you at least want
to know the truth?

00:19:17.122 --> 00:19:19.647
Let me prove who I am.

00:19:19.725 --> 00:19:21.818
Hand me that dermal regenerator.

00:19:43.182 --> 00:19:45.673
We're the same race.

00:19:49.922 --> 00:19:51.913
We're more than that.

00:19:51.990 --> 00:19:53.958
We're friends.

00:19:59.998 --> 00:20:02.091
Am I hearing you correctly?

00:20:02.167 --> 00:20:05.295
You're actually
helping this man?

00:20:07.739 --> 00:20:10.640
He abducted one of the workers.

00:20:10.709 --> 00:20:13.109
She's a member of his crew.

00:20:13.178 --> 00:20:15.840
Right... and you're the Captain.

00:20:15.914 --> 00:20:19.372
Don't you see
he's trying to convince you

00:20:19.451 --> 00:20:22.648
that you'll have a better life
if you go with him.

00:20:22.721 --> 00:20:26.157
Do you want to go with him?

00:20:26.225 --> 00:20:27.783
No.

00:20:27.859 --> 00:20:31.488
Then why are you risking
everything we have?

00:20:37.402 --> 00:20:38.699
I was starting to think...

00:20:39.738 --> 00:20:40.864
Stay where you are.

00:20:52.084 --> 00:20:53.745
I don't know them.

00:20:53.819 --> 00:20:55.343
I think you do,

00:20:55.420 --> 00:20:56.978
and I think you were involved

00:20:57.089 --> 00:20:58.613
in their disappearance.

00:21:00.392 --> 00:21:02.826
I'm not the man
you're looking for.

00:21:02.894 --> 00:21:05.454
Yes, the witness' description
doesn't fit you exactly,

00:21:05.530 --> 00:21:06.622
but I'm sure
that'll be explained

00:21:06.698 --> 00:21:08.131
once the doctor here
finds evidence

00:21:08.200 --> 00:21:10.862
of dermal regeneration.

00:21:12.904 --> 00:21:13.928
What is it?

00:21:14.039 --> 00:21:17.907
Some kind of...
communications device

00:21:17.976 --> 00:21:20.240
implanted under his skin.

00:21:20.312 --> 00:21:21.904
Remove it.

00:21:25.350 --> 00:21:26.612
Listen to me.

00:21:26.685 --> 00:21:28.585
You and I have
something in common.

00:21:28.654 --> 00:21:30.087
Oh?

00:21:30.155 --> 00:21:32.089
We're both investigating
disappearances.

00:21:32.157 --> 00:21:33.647
If you answer my questions,

00:21:33.725 --> 00:21:34.692
I'll answer yours.

00:21:37.462 --> 00:21:38.451
I have an order

00:21:38.530 --> 00:21:41.192
to transfer this
patient to Division 6.

00:21:41.266 --> 00:21:42.961
Division 6?

00:21:43.068 --> 00:21:44.092
Neuropathology.

00:21:44.169 --> 00:21:45.727
We have reason to believe
that he's mentally ill.

00:21:45.804 --> 00:21:47.738
He's lying.
How could they know that?

00:21:47.806 --> 00:21:48.738
They've never examined me.

00:21:48.807 --> 00:21:50.172
I'll come with you.

00:21:50.242 --> 00:21:51.675
I'm sorry, sir, but my orders

00:21:51.743 --> 00:21:53.677
are to bring him for
immediate treatment.

00:21:53.745 --> 00:21:55.337
This man is a suspect
in a serious crime.

00:21:55.414 --> 00:21:57.279
I'm not letting him
out of my sight.

00:21:57.349 --> 00:21:59.146
If you check the order,
you'll see it's been approved

00:21:59.217 --> 00:22:01.048
by the Director
of Investigations.

00:22:06.358 --> 00:22:07.848
My real name is Chakotay.

00:22:07.926 --> 00:22:10.554
I'm an officer aboard the
Federation Starship Voyager.

00:22:10.629 --> 00:22:12.221
Members of my crew
were abducted,

00:22:12.297 --> 00:22:14.288
and their memories were altered,
and they were put to work here.

00:22:14.366 --> 00:22:15.924
I can give you names,
descriptions!

00:22:16.068 --> 00:22:18.628
Listen to me!

00:22:19.705 --> 00:22:22.173
Ah...

00:22:26.044 --> 00:22:27.477
Smells good.

00:22:27.546 --> 00:22:28.911
Pancakes with maple syrup

00:22:28.980 --> 00:22:31.141
are your favorite breakfast.

00:22:31.216 --> 00:22:32.148
You know,

00:22:32.217 --> 00:22:34.651
sometimes food
is like time travel.

00:22:34.720 --> 00:22:37.951
You inhale an aroma,
take a bite of something,

00:22:38.056 --> 00:22:39.819
and suddenly, bam,
you're back at the moment

00:22:39.891 --> 00:22:42.951
you first tasted it.

00:22:43.061 --> 00:22:44.289
They're good.

00:22:44.363 --> 00:22:46.888
I'm not experiencing
time travel.

00:22:47.933 --> 00:22:49.195
What are you reading?

00:22:49.267 --> 00:22:50.928
Personal logs.

00:22:51.002 --> 00:22:53.766
Do you remember
recording any of them?

00:22:53.839 --> 00:22:56.069
Oh, they're not mine;
they're Tom's.

00:22:57.142 --> 00:22:59.576
Those are supposed
to be private.

00:22:59.644 --> 00:23:01.976
Well, he is my husband.

00:23:03.048 --> 00:23:04.015
What do they say?

00:23:04.082 --> 00:23:07.051
They're private...

00:23:08.120 --> 00:23:10.714
...but the way he
describes me...

00:23:10.789 --> 00:23:12.780
He loves you.

00:23:12.858 --> 00:23:16.419
I guess so.

00:23:16.495 --> 00:23:18.156
How do you feel?

00:23:19.998 --> 00:23:22.523
It's still a little foggy.

00:23:22.601 --> 00:23:23.932
That fog should lift.

00:23:24.035 --> 00:23:26.128
As soon as the Doctor
finishes your treatments.

00:23:26.204 --> 00:23:28.468
Yeah...

00:23:28.540 --> 00:23:32.772
but what about the guy
who recorded these logs?

00:23:32.844 --> 00:23:34.311
I've been analyzing
our scans

00:23:34.379 --> 00:23:36.472
of the Quarren patrol
ships that attacked us,

00:23:36.548 --> 00:23:38.482
and I think I've devised a way

00:23:38.550 --> 00:23:40.108
of evading their sensors.

00:23:40.185 --> 00:23:42.619
You do have a knack
for tactical planning.

00:23:42.687 --> 00:23:43.619
Hmm. That's something

00:23:43.688 --> 00:23:45.383
I've been meaning
to discuss with you.

00:23:45.457 --> 00:23:47.118
Once we've succeeded
in this mission,

00:23:47.192 --> 00:23:48.284
and I'm certain we will,

00:23:48.360 --> 00:23:50.055
I'd like you to
help me program

00:23:50.128 --> 00:23:52.323
a new medical hologram.

00:23:53.398 --> 00:23:54.490
You don't like the idea

00:23:54.566 --> 00:23:55.658
of going back to your old job

00:23:55.734 --> 00:23:57.167
now that you've had a taste
of command.

00:23:57.235 --> 00:23:58.896
I'm a skilled officer.

00:23:58.970 --> 00:24:02.030
No offense, Doc, but that
skill was programmed into you.

00:24:02.107 --> 00:24:03.199
- Yes, but...
- I'm sure

00:24:03.275 --> 00:24:04.401
once you're back
to your old self,

00:24:04.476 --> 00:24:06.205
you'll be happy
being a full-time doctor

00:24:06.278 --> 00:24:08.337
again.

00:24:11.049 --> 00:24:14.280
Commander Chakotay's
hailing us.

00:24:14.352 --> 00:24:16.115
We're receiving you, sir.
Go ahead.

00:24:16.188 --> 00:24:18.452
I'm having trouble
with my transceiver.

00:24:18.523 --> 00:24:20.616
This may be to last chance
we have to talk.

00:24:20.692 --> 00:24:22.057
What's your status?

00:24:22.127 --> 00:24:25.119
I'm almost ready
to shut down the shield grid.

00:24:25.197 --> 00:24:27.722
I'm sending you
encrypted instructions.

00:24:27.799 --> 00:24:30.199
They'll tell you where
and when to enter orbit.

00:24:30.268 --> 00:24:32.327
We have it, Commander.

00:24:32.404 --> 00:24:34.668
Chakotay out.

00:24:34.739 --> 00:24:37.207
Well, now you know
where to find Voyager...

00:24:37.275 --> 00:24:38.469
I'll have three ships with me.

00:24:38.543 --> 00:24:39.942
They won't escape again.

00:24:40.045 --> 00:24:41.945
If you'd done your
job the first time,

00:24:42.047 --> 00:24:44.641
we wouldn't have
a problem now.

00:24:49.321 --> 00:24:51.482
Don't you have patients
to attend to?

00:24:51.556 --> 00:24:53.490
Uh, yes, sir.

00:24:53.558 --> 00:24:54.957
I've been thinking.

00:24:55.093 --> 00:24:56.560
This is the second
person we've admitted

00:24:56.628 --> 00:24:58.255
with Dysphoria
Syndrome in two days,

00:24:58.330 --> 00:24:59.922
and they both work
at the power plant.

00:24:59.998 --> 00:25:01.898
Maybe we should
issue a health alert,

00:25:01.967 --> 00:25:03.594
examine the rest
of the workers.

00:25:03.668 --> 00:25:05.795
Do you think
I'm incompetent?

00:25:05.871 --> 00:25:07.498
Sir?

00:25:07.572 --> 00:25:10.200
This man is in charge
of personnel

00:25:10.275 --> 00:25:11.902
at the power facility.

00:25:12.043 --> 00:25:14.568
I've informed him
of the situation.

00:25:14.646 --> 00:25:15.738
We're already taking steps

00:25:15.814 --> 00:25:16.746
to ensure the safety

00:25:16.815 --> 00:25:19.443
of all of our employees.

00:25:19.518 --> 00:25:22.112
I'm sorry to have bothered you.

00:25:22.187 --> 00:25:24.815
No need to apologize, Doctor.

00:25:24.890 --> 00:25:27.222
Your concern for your patients
is admirable,

00:25:27.292 --> 00:25:28.224
but don't worry.

00:25:28.293 --> 00:25:31.456
The man is already
responding to treatment.

00:25:31.530 --> 00:25:33.998
I expect a full recovery.

00:25:37.369 --> 00:25:38.734
Why would this Tuvok
be collecting

00:25:38.803 --> 00:25:40.134
information about
his coworkers?

00:25:40.205 --> 00:25:41.467
I don't know,

00:25:41.540 --> 00:25:44.168
but the name on one of those
files is B'Elanna Torres.

00:25:44.242 --> 00:25:48.110
They both began working
at the plant on the same day,

00:25:48.179 --> 00:25:51.444
along with 136 others,
including myself.

00:25:51.516 --> 00:25:53.916
What's unusual about that?

00:25:53.985 --> 00:25:57.250
More than 100 skilled employees,
most of them the same species,

00:25:57.322 --> 00:25:59.756
acquired in a single day...

00:25:59.824 --> 00:26:01.348
during a labor shortage?

00:26:01.426 --> 00:26:03.155
You'll also note
that every one of them

00:26:03.228 --> 00:26:05.128
was processed
through the Central Hospital

00:26:05.196 --> 00:26:06.128
when they arrived.

00:26:06.197 --> 00:26:08.597
It's routine for new
workers to be examined.

00:26:08.667 --> 00:26:10.225
Yes, by Quarantine Control,

00:26:10.302 --> 00:26:11.894
but everyone on this list...

00:26:12.003 --> 00:26:13.027
all of them...

00:26:13.104 --> 00:26:15.299
were processed
through Division 6.

00:26:15.373 --> 00:26:18.467
You came through
Neuropathology?

00:26:18.543 --> 00:26:20.101
That's what
the records indicate,

00:26:20.178 --> 00:26:22.203
but I don't remember
being there.

00:26:24.115 --> 00:26:26.845
What do you expect me to do?

00:26:26.918 --> 00:26:28.647
You can start
by interviewing Mr. Tuvok.

00:26:28.720 --> 00:26:30.347
You'll find him
at the hospital.

00:26:30.422 --> 00:26:31.389
Why is he there?

00:26:32.457 --> 00:26:35.483
He became
emotionally unstable.

00:26:35.560 --> 00:26:38.825
Even if I wanted to
help you, I couldn't.

00:26:38.897 --> 00:26:40.228
Why not?

00:26:40.298 --> 00:26:41.925
The Director of Investigations

00:26:42.033 --> 00:26:43.898
relieved me of duty
this morning.

00:26:44.936 --> 00:26:47.234
Yerid, I thought that was you.

00:26:47.305 --> 00:26:49.796
Have you found out
anything about B'Elanna?

00:26:49.874 --> 00:26:51.068
He can't assist you.

00:26:51.142 --> 00:26:53.838
He's been relieved of duty.

00:26:53.912 --> 00:26:54.844
Oh.

00:26:54.913 --> 00:26:56.540
This man's also in Tuvok's file.

00:26:58.483 --> 00:26:59.507
What file?

00:27:00.552 --> 00:27:02.213
Why don't you tell him?

00:27:02.287 --> 00:27:04.187
Tell me what?

00:27:04.255 --> 00:27:07.019
I can't go back to the hospital
and start asking questions.

00:27:07.092 --> 00:27:10.892
I'd be reported.

00:27:11.029 --> 00:27:14.055
Maybe I can help.

00:27:14.165 --> 00:27:18.261
Recently, I've been...

00:27:18.336 --> 00:27:20.429
I'm a doctor.
You can trust me.

00:27:23.508 --> 00:27:26.068
I've been experiencing...

00:27:26.144 --> 00:27:28.237
some disturbing thoughts.

00:27:28.313 --> 00:27:29.905
I don't believe
it's anything serious,

00:27:30.048 --> 00:27:31.777
but I would like
to speak with someone.

00:27:31.850 --> 00:27:34.478
Well, you've come
to the right place.

00:27:39.858 --> 00:27:44.090
Guest Labor Code Green,
Employee 8586.

00:27:46.898 --> 00:27:49.298
Hansen, Annika.

00:27:49.367 --> 00:27:51.460
You've been a
patient here before.

00:27:51.536 --> 00:27:54.164
Yes, when I first arrived.

00:27:54.239 --> 00:27:57.299
You were treated for
Dysphoria Syndrome.

00:27:57.375 --> 00:28:00.037
I don't recall that.

00:28:00.111 --> 00:28:02.011
These disturbing
thoughts you mentioned...

00:28:02.080 --> 00:28:03.877
would you characterize
them as hallucinations?

00:28:03.982 --> 00:28:05.882
What's the cause
of this syndrome?

00:28:05.984 --> 00:28:08.214
We're-we're conducting
studies to determine that.

00:28:08.286 --> 00:28:10.588
Fortunately, we have one
of the foremost experts

00:28:10.689 --> 00:28:11.986
on the condition
working here.

00:28:12.057 --> 00:28:13.615
I'd like to speak
with this expert.

00:28:13.692 --> 00:28:15.660
- Well, Dr. Kadan's very busy.
- So am I.

00:28:15.727 --> 00:28:17.354
Perhaps I should return
when he's free.

00:28:17.429 --> 00:28:20.159
Uh, wait here.
I'll find him.

00:28:34.713 --> 00:28:35.907
Yes?

00:28:36.047 --> 00:28:37.139
My name is Yerid.

00:28:37.215 --> 00:28:38.910
I'm from Criminal
Investigations.

00:28:39.050 --> 00:28:40.483
How can I help you?

00:28:40.552 --> 00:28:42.884
Kathryn Janeway?

00:28:42.954 --> 00:28:44.546
Yes?

00:28:49.227 --> 00:28:52.287
Do you know this man?

00:28:54.899 --> 00:28:56.924
No.

00:28:57.001 --> 00:28:58.764
I thought maybe
you'd met him.

00:28:58.837 --> 00:29:00.270
Why?

00:29:00.338 --> 00:29:02.135
He was found
in your former living quarters,

00:29:02.207 --> 00:29:03.765
in possession
of a dermal regenerator

00:29:03.842 --> 00:29:05.742
that you removed
from the plant.

00:29:05.810 --> 00:29:07.072
I was the one
who helped him.

00:29:07.145 --> 00:29:09.739
Jaffen...

00:29:15.987 --> 00:29:18.717
He said he was
from a starship,

00:29:18.790 --> 00:29:21.623
and that members of his crew
had been abducted.

00:29:21.693 --> 00:29:23.627
He was obviously lying.

00:29:23.695 --> 00:29:26.061
I want to know
everything he told you.

00:29:30.168 --> 00:29:31.795
How could she just walk out?

00:29:31.870 --> 00:29:33.804
She was a
voluntary patient.

00:29:33.872 --> 00:29:36.807
There was no reason
for Security to stop her.

00:29:36.875 --> 00:29:38.809
She accessed
64 restricted files,

00:29:38.877 --> 00:29:42.313
all of them for people diagnosed
with Dysphoria Syndrome.

00:29:42.380 --> 00:29:43.904
According to the records,

00:29:44.048 --> 00:29:46.482
those patients were
all admitted on the same day,

00:29:46.551 --> 00:29:47.916
and you're listed

00:29:48.052 --> 00:29:50.316
as the attending physician
in every case.

00:29:50.388 --> 00:29:51.514
Oh, yes, I remember.

00:29:51.589 --> 00:29:52.920
Quite-quite an outbreak.

00:29:53.057 --> 00:29:54.820
You've never mentioned it.

00:29:54.893 --> 00:29:56.918
Well, I'm sorry if
I haven't kept you

00:29:57.061 --> 00:29:59.154
properly informed
about my patients.

00:29:59.230 --> 00:30:00.925
Every one of them
was discharged

00:30:01.032 --> 00:30:02.522
to the Main Power Authority.

00:30:02.600 --> 00:30:03.794
That supervisor
you were talking to...

00:30:03.868 --> 00:30:05.130
that's where he worked.

00:30:05.203 --> 00:30:06.932
I explained that to you.

00:30:07.071 --> 00:30:11.007
I was informing him
about a potential health threat.

00:30:13.244 --> 00:30:15.508
That plant worker,
Amal Kotay...

00:30:15.580 --> 00:30:17.844
he claimed that his friends
had been abducted

00:30:17.916 --> 00:30:20.942
and put to work after having
their memories altered.

00:30:21.019 --> 00:30:22.953
What are you implying?

00:30:23.021 --> 00:30:26.650
You're making
false diagnoses,

00:30:26.724 --> 00:30:29.955
selectively changing
what people remember

00:30:30.061 --> 00:30:32.552
and then sending them
to work at the power plant.

00:30:33.698 --> 00:30:36.292
Very good, Doctor.

00:30:36.367 --> 00:30:38.631
Why?

00:30:38.703 --> 00:30:41.137
A physician with more experience

00:30:41.206 --> 00:30:44.437
would be able to see this
in the larger context.

00:30:44.509 --> 00:30:47.967
The true public health threat
is the labor shortage,

00:30:48.046 --> 00:30:51.379
and the only cure is to find
more skilled workers.

00:30:51.449 --> 00:30:54.612
We're doctors; we're not
supposed to harm patients.

00:30:54.686 --> 00:30:58.213
We're helping them to lead
productive, happy lives.

00:30:58.289 --> 00:30:59.916
By altering
their memories?

00:30:59.991 --> 00:31:02.221
The treatment I provide
improves their lives

00:31:02.293 --> 00:31:04.557
and makes them
better workers.

00:31:04.629 --> 00:31:07.120
In turn,
our economy benefits.

00:31:10.668 --> 00:31:13.102
You're profiting from this,
aren't you?

00:31:13.171 --> 00:31:14.900
Doesn't a physician deserve

00:31:14.973 --> 00:31:17.601
to be compensated
for his services?

00:31:17.675 --> 00:31:19.734
I'll report you.

00:31:19.811 --> 00:31:21.244
To whom?

00:31:21.312 --> 00:31:24.770
My research is funded
by the Ministry of Health.

00:31:24.849 --> 00:31:27.443
Well, Criminal
Investigations, then.

00:31:28.519 --> 00:31:30.749
As you may recall,

00:31:30.822 --> 00:31:33.916
the Director of Investigations
was the one who ordered

00:31:33.992 --> 00:31:38.588
Amal Kotay be placed
under my care.

00:31:39.664 --> 00:31:42.292
Does everyone know about this?

00:31:42.367 --> 00:31:46.133
Not everyone.
Just a few trusted associates.

00:31:47.205 --> 00:31:50.106
The question is:

00:31:50.174 --> 00:31:52.642
Are you going to be one of them?

00:31:56.047 --> 00:31:58.106
She's considered dangerous.

00:31:58.182 --> 00:32:00.082
She's never been in here.

00:32:00.151 --> 00:32:01.914
You're sure?

00:32:01.986 --> 00:32:04.750
I don't think
I'd forget that face.

00:32:04.822 --> 00:32:07.256
If you do see her,
report it immediately.

00:32:07.325 --> 00:32:09.293
She needs to be hospitalized.

00:32:14.332 --> 00:32:16.129
It's safe now.

00:32:20.705 --> 00:32:21.933
Thank you.

00:32:22.040 --> 00:32:23.905
Well, if you really
want to thank me,

00:32:23.975 --> 00:32:26.273
you can tell me
what's going on.

00:32:26.344 --> 00:32:29.245
It appears this Chakotay
was telling the truth.

00:32:29.314 --> 00:32:31.248
So, uh, every worker
at the plant

00:32:31.316 --> 00:32:32.578
had their memories altered?

00:32:32.650 --> 00:32:34.311
I don't believe
it's every worker.

00:32:34.385 --> 00:32:36.615
Your name didn't appear
in Dr. Kadan's patient files,

00:32:36.688 --> 00:32:38.155
but mine did.

00:32:38.222 --> 00:32:39.587
So did yours.

00:32:39.657 --> 00:32:41.784
We should report this
to the authorities.

00:32:41.859 --> 00:32:43.121
I'll need more evidence

00:32:43.194 --> 00:32:45.924
before I start
making accusations.

00:32:45.997 --> 00:32:48.966
Chakotay said he had proof
of my real identity...

00:32:49.067 --> 00:32:51.331
aboard a ship called Voyager.

00:32:51.402 --> 00:32:53.563
How can we locate it?

00:32:53.638 --> 00:32:55.936
When his crew contacted him,

00:32:56.007 --> 00:32:58.271
they were using...

00:32:58.343 --> 00:33:00.675
a triaxilating frequency

00:33:00.745 --> 00:33:03.043
on a covariant subspace band.

00:33:03.114 --> 00:33:06.675
There's a subspace transponder
at the power plant.

00:33:09.954 --> 00:33:11.717
I'm going back to the plant

00:33:11.789 --> 00:33:14.223
to try to contact this ship.

00:33:14.292 --> 00:33:16.522
I understand if you don't want
to be involved.

00:33:16.594 --> 00:33:19.688
I've been involved
from the moment I met you.

00:33:19.764 --> 00:33:22.232
If I were to return
to the hospital

00:33:22.300 --> 00:33:23.858
in your custody,

00:33:23.935 --> 00:33:26.802
it would give us an opportunity
to help Chakotay and Tuvok.

00:33:28.906 --> 00:33:30.305
I had to sedate her.

00:33:30.375 --> 00:33:32.434
She wouldn't
come voluntarily.

00:33:32.510 --> 00:33:35.104
Her condition's
obviously worsened.

00:33:35.179 --> 00:33:36.612
I'll treat her.

00:33:36.681 --> 00:33:40.048
There are some other patients
I'd like to interview.

00:33:43.688 --> 00:33:45.451
These people can't be disturbed.

00:33:51.129 --> 00:33:54.223
I suggest you comply.

00:34:02.807 --> 00:34:04.297
Be careful.

00:34:23.027 --> 00:34:23.925
We're being hailed.

00:34:24.062 --> 00:34:25.029
On screen.

00:34:27.331 --> 00:34:29.094
Starship Voyager...

00:34:29.167 --> 00:34:30.657
Captain?

00:34:30.735 --> 00:34:33.932
Why don't you
just call me Kathryn?

00:34:34.005 --> 00:34:36.337
Yes, ma'am.
Where's Commander Chakotay?

00:34:36.407 --> 00:34:37.931
Hospitalized.

00:34:38.076 --> 00:34:39.941
He told me

00:34:40.011 --> 00:34:44.710
you had proof...
of who some of us really are.

00:34:44.782 --> 00:34:46.306
We do.

00:34:46.384 --> 00:34:49.615
You're the woman
who was abducted.

00:34:49.687 --> 00:34:51.279
Chakotay was supposed
to deactivate the shield grid,

00:34:51.355 --> 00:34:54.381
so we could transport you
and the others to safety.

00:34:54.459 --> 00:34:56.427
If you could find a way
to shut down main power,

00:34:56.494 --> 00:34:57.893
the shield grid
will go down, too.

00:34:57.962 --> 00:34:59.691
Will you help us?

00:35:02.266 --> 00:35:03.893
We're under attack.

00:35:03.968 --> 00:35:05.492
Three ships.

00:35:11.209 --> 00:35:13.507
Please, shut down
the shield gr...

00:35:23.821 --> 00:35:25.789
Jaffen?

00:35:29.660 --> 00:35:31.457
Stop!

00:35:49.814 --> 00:35:51.042
Don't move!

00:35:57.188 --> 00:35:59.452
Stay where you are.

00:36:10.101 --> 00:36:12.194
I hope you didn't think
I abandoned you.

00:36:12.270 --> 00:36:13.532
Never occurred to me.

00:36:13.604 --> 00:36:16.903
We need to shut down
the main generators.

00:36:19.110 --> 00:36:21.908
So much for evading
their sensors.

00:36:22.046 --> 00:36:23.206
The only way they
could've found us

00:36:23.281 --> 00:36:25.579
is if they knew
exactly where to look.

00:36:27.752 --> 00:36:30.414
Transporters are off-line.

00:36:36.928 --> 00:36:40.728
We'll never get to
the generator controls.

00:36:40.798 --> 00:36:43.289
Maybe we don't have to.

00:36:43.367 --> 00:36:44.857
What are you doing?

00:36:44.936 --> 00:36:46.563
If I can make
the computer think

00:36:46.637 --> 00:36:48.070
the core is going to overload,

00:36:48.139 --> 00:36:51.438
the main power should
automatically shut down.

00:37:05.323 --> 00:37:08.190
Ask them to give us
some privacy.

00:37:08.259 --> 00:37:10.056
You're dismissed.

00:37:12.597 --> 00:37:14.326
Disconnect them.

00:37:19.036 --> 00:37:21.470
Dr. Ravoc?

00:37:21.539 --> 00:37:23.905
Why is this man here?

00:37:23.975 --> 00:37:26.671
Dysphoria Syndrome.

00:37:29.947 --> 00:37:32.745
We're losing shields.

00:37:32.817 --> 00:37:35.217
Any advice
from your tactical database?

00:37:35.286 --> 00:37:37.516
Nothing relevant.

00:37:37.588 --> 00:37:39.852
How many escape pods
do we have left?

00:37:39.924 --> 00:37:41.721
Five.

00:37:41.792 --> 00:37:43.225
Stand by to eject three of them.

00:37:43.294 --> 00:37:45.558
I don't think abandoning ship
is the answer.

00:37:45.630 --> 00:37:47.291
Neither do I.
Can you create a dampening field

00:37:47.365 --> 00:37:49.356
around the briefing room
that'll mask our life signs?

00:37:49.433 --> 00:37:51.094
I believe so. Why?

00:37:51.168 --> 00:37:52.692
Watch and learn.

00:38:01.512 --> 00:38:03.537
Your crew's abandoned you again.

00:38:03.614 --> 00:38:05.878
I suggest you surrender
your vessel.

00:38:05.950 --> 00:38:09.818
You should realize by now that
I'm not programmed to do that.

00:38:17.762 --> 00:38:19.093
Bravo, Ensign.

00:38:19.163 --> 00:38:21.529
B'Elanna, I need
those transporters.

00:38:22.800 --> 00:38:24.893
You better hurry up.

00:38:24.969 --> 00:38:28.370
Come on... do it.

00:38:28.439 --> 00:38:32.239
Warning. Core overload detected.

00:38:32.310 --> 00:38:35.108
Initiating emergency shutdown.

00:38:37.248 --> 00:38:38.738
We've got to go!

00:38:47.158 --> 00:38:48.887
Their shield grid's failing.

00:38:49.660 --> 00:38:51.218
B'Elanna?

00:38:51.295 --> 00:38:53.729
Transporters are coming
on line... now!

00:39:08.479 --> 00:39:08.579
ECH Log, supplemental.

00:39:08.579 --> 00:39:11.104
ECH Log, supplemental.

00:39:11.182 --> 00:39:13.878
All the crew have been
transported back to Voyager,

00:39:14.018 --> 00:39:16.282
and thanks to my experience
with Lieutenant Torres,

00:39:16.354 --> 00:39:18.754
their treatment
is proceeding rapidly.

00:39:18.823 --> 00:39:20.085
While they're recovering,

00:39:20.157 --> 00:39:22.887
I still have a few command
duties left to perform.

00:39:22.960 --> 00:39:24.723
If it weren't
for your efforts,

00:39:24.795 --> 00:39:28.094
this whole conspiracy might
never have been uncovered.

00:39:28.165 --> 00:39:29.655
What'll happen to the workers?

00:39:29.734 --> 00:39:31.031
Well, we've identified
several thousand

00:39:31.102 --> 00:39:32.899
of Dr. Kadan's patients.

00:39:33.003 --> 00:39:34.868
Once they're treated,
they'll be repatriated.

00:39:34.939 --> 00:39:36.873
We appreciate everything
you've done.

00:39:36.941 --> 00:39:38.568
This way.

00:40:06.303 --> 00:40:09.101
Ooh!

00:40:20.317 --> 00:40:22.410
What's that for?

00:40:22.486 --> 00:40:24.215
For taking care of me,

00:40:24.288 --> 00:40:27.280
even when you didn't know
who I was.

00:40:31.328 --> 00:40:32.955
Ow!

00:40:33.030 --> 00:40:34.327
What was that for?

00:40:34.398 --> 00:40:36.593
Flirting with your customers.

00:40:36.667 --> 00:40:39.966
I was a victim of mind control.

00:40:41.372 --> 00:40:42.964
Mm-hmm.

00:40:56.654 --> 00:40:59.088
I can see why
you'd rather live here.

00:40:59.156 --> 00:41:01.522
I'd offer you a position.

00:41:01.592 --> 00:41:04.686
I could always use
another skilled engineer.

00:41:04.762 --> 00:41:08.027
But as the Captain...

00:41:08.098 --> 00:41:11.932
it wouldn't really be
appropriate for me to...

00:41:12.002 --> 00:41:14.197
Fraternize with a member
of your crew.

00:41:16.373 --> 00:41:19.069
Well, at least my memories
weren't tampered with.

00:41:19.143 --> 00:41:20.940
According
to the medical reports,

00:41:21.011 --> 00:41:23.946
I really did come to Quarra
looking for a better life,

00:41:24.048 --> 00:41:27.211
and now that I've been promoted,
I guess I've succeeded.

00:41:27.284 --> 00:41:29.218
Promotion?

00:41:29.286 --> 00:41:32.722
They had to replace
our shift supervisor.

00:41:32.790 --> 00:41:36.419
Something about acquiring
workers illegally.

00:41:36.494 --> 00:41:37.825
Congratulations.

00:41:37.895 --> 00:41:40.090
You deserve it.

00:41:40.164 --> 00:41:41.495
I thought you might

00:41:41.565 --> 00:41:42.930
like these back...

00:41:43.000 --> 00:41:47.232
to remind you
of our time together.

00:41:47.304 --> 00:41:50.899
I won't need souvenirs
to remember you.

00:42:14.265 --> 00:42:16.495
Captain on the Bridge!

00:42:34.685 --> 00:42:36.346
Ready to go?

00:42:36.420 --> 00:42:39.787
It may not have been real,
Chakotay,

00:42:39.857 --> 00:42:41.791
but it felt like home.

00:42:41.859 --> 00:42:43.884
If you hadn't come after me,

00:42:43.961 --> 00:42:48.295
I never would've known
that I had another life.

00:42:48.365 --> 00:42:50.697
Are you sorry I showed up?

00:42:53.437 --> 00:42:55.462
Not for a second.

00:42:57.575 --> 00:43:00.271
Resume course, Mr. Paris.

00:43:00.344 --> 00:43:02.335
Aye, sir.
